{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 58,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.12979888916016,
        27.289522171020508,
        340.4130554199219,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "RECOMMENDATIONS FOR MANAGEMENT OF COMMON CHILDHOOD CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.0429382324219,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "antibiotics. Children 2 to 59 months of age with severe pneumonia received either day",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.0328674316406,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "care, with injectable ceftriaxone once daily for 5 days, feeding, and supportive care",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        399.08282470703125,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "(n = 180) or hospital care (n = 180) with similar 24-hour treatment. The mean ± SD",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        98.74208068847656,
        399.022705078125,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "durations of day care and hospital care were 7.1 ± 2.3 and 6.5 ±2.8 days, respectively.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        111.74208068847656,
        399.1011657714844,
        125.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "Primary outcome was treatment success based on SpO  > 95% in-room air. In the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        283.53131103515625,
        119.0282211303711,
        286.41131591796875,
        127.12222290039062
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        124.74208068847656,
        399.0428466796875,
        138.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "day care group, 24 (13.3%) children failed therapy, while in the hospital care group 7",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        137.74208068847656,
        399.0928649902344,
        151.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "(3.9%) children failed therapy (RR 3.4, 95% CI 1.5 to 7.8) with the difference in failure",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        150.74208068847656,
        399.1082763671875,
        164.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "rate being predominantly due to hypoxaemia defined as SpO  ≤ 95%. During the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        311.8984069824219,
        158.02821350097656,
        314.7784118652344,
        166.12222290039062
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 6.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        163.7421112060547,
        399.0726623535156,
        177.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "follow-up period, 22 (14.1%) children in the day care group and 11 (6.4%) children in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        176.7421112060547,
        399.05279541015625,
        190.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "the hospital care group required readmission to hospitals (RR 2.0, 95% CI 0.99 to 4.0).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        189.7421112060547,
        399.12286376953125,
        203.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "Two children died in the hospital group during the 3-month follow-up period. The",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        202.7421112060547,
        399.06280517578125,
        216.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "estimated cost per child treated successfully at the clinic and the hospital were US$",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        215.7421112060547,
        177.11293029785156,
        229.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "114 and US$ 178, respectively.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        240.2606964111328,
        166.46292114257812,
        252.25070190429688
      ],
      "text": "6.3.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        255.9053955078125,
        88.77290344238281,
        268.0453796386719
      ],
      "text": "Benefits",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        268.9153747558594,
        399.11285400390625,
        282.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "Oral antibiotic therapy will be favorable to the health system as it will be less",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        281.9153747558594,
        399.04296875,
        295.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "expensive and will lead to reduced burden on the health system. Despite concerns",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        294.9153747558594,
        399.0428466796875,
        308.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "about reported in vitro (laboratory) resistance of pneumococcus to penicillin, there",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        307.9153747558594,
        396.8229064941406,
        321.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "are no reports of clinical failure. Oral amoxicillin is more effective than oral co-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        320.9153747558594,
        340.54290771484375,
        334.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "trimoxazole for the treatment of severe pneumonia (chest indrawing).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        342.4093017578125,
        78.65290069580078,
        354.5492858886719
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        355.4192810058594,
        399.0627746582031,
        368.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "Amoxicillin is a very safe drug. Mild adverse events like skin rash and diarrhoea may",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        368.4192810058594,
        399.10284423828125,
        381.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "occur in a small number of children. In rare cases, penicillin-related anaphylactic",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        381.4192810058594,
        113.3529052734375,
        394.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "reaction may.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        405.9378967285156,
        205.30300903320312,
        417.9278869628906
      ],
      "text": "6.3.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        421.59246826171875,
        399.03277587890625,
        435.0824890136719
      ],
      "text": "Home treatment with a 5-day course of amoxicillin is preferable, because of the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        434.59246826171875,
        399.0729064941406,
        448.0824890136719
      ],
      "text": "associated reduction in referral, admission, risk of nosocomial infections, and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        447.59246826171875,
        399.1329345703125,
        461.0824890136719
      ],
      "text": "treatment costs as well as the reduced invasiveness of oral treatment when compared",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        460.59246826171875,
        399.1329040527344,
        474.0824890136719
      ],
      "text": "with parenteral treatment. Day care treatment with injectable ceftriaxone would be",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        473.59246826171875,
        399.1529541015625,
        487.0824890136719
      ],
      "text": "much more expensive than oral antibiotic treatment at home. Cost of amoxicillin",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        486.59246826171875,
        399.0328063964844,
        500.0824890136719
      ],
      "text": "250 mg is US$ 0.018 per capsule and US$ 0.022 per dispersible tablet. Cost of injectable",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        499.59246826171875,
        399.01287841796875,
        513.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "benzyl penicillin 1 million i.u (600 mg) is US$ 0.354 and of injectable ceftriaxone 1G",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        512.5924682617188,
        265.65283203125,
        526.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "is US$ 1.056, which is higher than oral amoxicillin.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        525.5924682617188,
        399.0414123535156,
        539.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "It is feasible to distribute oral amoxicillin in resource-limited settings as it is",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        538.5924682617188,
        157.74288940429688,
        552.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "available in all countries.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        563.111083984375,
        291.3228759765625,
        575.1011352539062
      ],
      "text": "6.4\t Antibiotics treatment for very severe pneumonia",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        578.7658081054688,
        399.0628662109375,
        592.2557983398438
      ],
      "text": "1.\t Children aged 2–59 months with very severe pneumonia should be treated with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        591.7658081054688,
        374.8714599609375,
        605.2557983398438
      ],
      "text": "parenteral ampicillin (or penicillin) and gentamicin as a first line treatment.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        604.7658081054688,
        399.09149169921875,
        618.2557983398438
      ],
      "text": "—\t Ampicillin: 50 mg/kg, or Benzyl penicillin: 50,000 units per kg IM/IV every",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.20469665527344,
        617.7658081054688,
        183.8847198486328,
        631.2557983398438
      ],
      "text": "6 hours for at least 5 days",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.34579467773438,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.6977996826172,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "44",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}